# Motion: Full (Settings -> Display), then the feedback of clicks that cannot do anything, captured mid-animation:
# a click on Black's pawn on White's turn shakes its card, flashes the square red and says why under the ruler.
# Settings layout: Settings (150,490); Display tab (880,172); Motion cycle (700,532); Back (125,25).
wait 20
click 150 490
wait 30
click 880 172
wait 20
click 700 532        # Motion: Reduced -> Full
wait 10
click 125 25
wait 30
mode standard
wait 120
clicksq 0 0 e7       # Black's pawn, White to move: refused
wait 2
capture motion-shake-f3
wait 3
capture motion-shake-f7
wait 5
capture motion-shake-f13
wait 60
capture motion-shake-settled
clicksq 0 0 e2       # a legal pick-up still works
wait 40
clicksq 0 0 e4
wait 60
clicksq 0 0 d2       # the old board is history now: refused with its own reason
wait 4
capture motion-shake-history
